  "content": "<div class=\"u_1486369071 dmNewParagraph\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1486369071\" style=\"transition: none; text-align: left;\"><p class=\"text-align-center m-size-29 size-36\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.11em;\"><span class=\"font-size-36 m-font-size-29\" style=\"text-decoration: underline; display: unset; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">2026-27 SEASON</span></p></div><div class=\"u_1887927626 dmNewParagraph\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1887927626\" style=\"transition: none; text-align: left;\"><p class=\"m-size-24 text-align-center size-30\"><strong class=\"m-font-size-24 font-size-30\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\">Brahms &amp; Beethoven</strong></p><p class=\"text-align-center m-size-19 size-24\"><span class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\">October 16 - 17, 2026</span></p><p class=\"text-align-center m-size-19 size-24\"><span class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\">The VETS, Providence</span></p></div><div class=\"u_DetailsIconAnchor dmNewParagraph\" data-anchor=\"Details Icon Anchor\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"DetailsIconAnchor\" style=\"transition: none 0s ease 0s; display: block; text-align: left;\"> <h2><strong style=\"display: initial; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Concert Details</strong></h2>\n</div><div class=\"u_1719886704 dmNewParagraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1719886704\" style=\"transition: none 0s ease 0s; display: block; text-align: left;\"><p class=\"m-size-16 size-20\"><strong class=\"m-font-size-19 font-size-24\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\">Amica Rush Hour Concert:</strong><span style=\"display: initial;\"><span style=\"display: initial;\">\u00a0</span>\n</span><strong class=\"m-font-size-16 font-size-20\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; display: initial;\"><br/>Friday, October 16, 6:30PM</strong></p> <ul class=\"defaultList bullet\"><li class=\"m-size-19 size-16\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"font-size-16 m-font-size-19\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Runtime is approximately 117 minutes including a 20 minute intermission.</span></li><li class=\"m-size-19 size-16\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"font-size-16 m-font-size-19\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none;\">There will be a post-concert Q&amp;A after the concert with Ruth Reinhardt &amp; Denis Kozhukhin.</span><span style=\"display: initial;\"><br/></span></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"display: initial;\"><br/></span></p><p class=\"m-size-16 size-20\"><strong class=\"m-font-size-19 font-size-24\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\">TACO Classical Concert:</strong><span single-space=\"true\" style=\"display: initial;\"> <span style=\"display: initial;\"></span>\n</span><strong class=\"m-font-size-16 font-size-20\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; display: initial;\"><br/>Saturday, October 17, 7:30PM</strong></p> <ul class=\"defaultList bullet\"><li class=\"m-size-19 size-16\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"font-size-16 m-font-size-19\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Runtime is approximately 117 minutes including a 20 minute intermission.</span></li><li class=\"m-size-19 size-16\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span class=\"font-size-16 m-font-size-19\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial; font-weight: normal; text-decoration: none;\">There will be a post-concert Q&amp;A after the concert with Ruth Reinhardt &amp; Denis Kozhukhin.</span><span style=\"display: initial;\"><br/></span></li></ul>\n</div><div class=\"dmNewParagraph\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1899346547\" style=\"transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out;\"><p class=\"m-size-36 size-45\"><strong class=\"m-font-size-36 font-size-45\" style=\"font-weight: bold; display: unset; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">About the Music</strong></p></div><div class=\"u_1678221425 dmNewParagraph\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1678221425\" style=\"transition: none 0s ease 0s; display: block; text-align: left;\"><p class=\"m-size-19 size-24\"><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\">PARRY:</strong>\n<strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">Elegy for Brahms</strong></p><p class=\"m-size-19 size-24\"><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\">BRAHMS: Symphony No.3</strong></p><p class=\"m-size-19 size-24\"><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\">BEETHOVEN: Piano Concerto No.5 (</strong><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">Emperor</strong><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold;\">)</strong></p><p><span style=\"display: initial;\"><br/></span></p><p class=\"m-size-19 size-24\"><strong class=\"font-size-24 m-font-size-19\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\">Performing Artists</strong></p><p class=\"size-18 m-size-14\"><a class=\"font-size-18 m-font-size-14\" href=\"https://www.riphil.org/orchestra-personnel\" runtime_url=\"https://www.riphil.org/orchestra-personnel\" style=\"display: initial; color: rgb(235, 238, 255); text-decoration: underline;\" target=\"_blank\" type=\"url\">The Rhode Island Philharmonic Orchestra</a></p><p class=\"size-18 m-size-14\"><a class=\"font-size-18 m-font-size-14\" href=\"https://ruth-reinhardt.com/\" runtime_url=\"https://ruth-reinhardt.com/\" style=\"display: initial; text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" target=\"_blank\" type=\"url\">Ruth Reinhardt, conductor</a></p><p class=\"size-18 m-size-14\"><a class=\"font-size-18 m-font-size-14\" href=\"https://deniskozhukhin.com/\" runtime_url=\"https://deniskozhukhin.com/\" style=\"display: initial; text-decoration: underline; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" target=\"_blank\" type=\"url\">Denis Kozhukhin, piano</a></p><p><span style=\"display: initial;\"><br/></span></p></div><div background-image\":\"\"}\"=\"\" class=\"u_1090736037 dmNewParagraph\" data-ai-tag=\"Paragraph\" data-element-type=\"paragraph\" data-styletopreserve=\"{\" data-version=\"5\" id=\"1090736037\" style=\"\"><p class=\"text-align-left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\">The VETS in Providence is the home of the Rhode Island Philharmonic Orchestra. Since 1950, The VETS has held a unique place in the cultural life of Rhode Island as a performance venue for legendary artists, local performers and community traditions.</span></p><p class=\"text-align-left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\"><br/></span></p><p class=\"text-align-left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: initial;\">On the National Register of Historic Places, The VETS is located on the revitalized Avenue of the Arts across from the R</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: unset;\">I State House. With just over 2,000 seats, it is acclaimed for its unique combination of size and intimacy. The theater celebrates flawless acoustics, a breathtaking proscenium stage and exquisite interior with a one-of-a-kind ceiling featuring the shields of RI's original 39 communities.</span></p></div>",
